WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.840
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.320
I'm Kurata Sana, age 11.
I'm a sixth grader,

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:37.410
who's also in Gekidan Komawari,
and active as an entertainer.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.740
My favorite food is
crushed corn flakes!

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:41.740
Best served freshly made,
and it's good for your digestion.

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.040
My favorite expression is
"Boo an being slapdash. "

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:46.210
Kurata Misako, my Mama.

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.080
She's a famous novelist, who has
even won an Aoki Laureate Prize!

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:50.920
Mischievous Mama... scary Mama...
kind Mama... flustered Mama...

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.800
they're all nice!

00:01:53.760 --> 00:01:56.260
Sagami Rei-kun. He's both
my chauffeur and my manager,

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.090
as well as my former boyfriend...
and former pimp?

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:03.220
Originally, he was homeless,
but I brought him home with me!

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.940
After that, he was my boyfriend
for along time...

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:17.070
A lot has happened. A lot can happen,
huh, as you go on living?

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:21.120
Now he's working his way to
becoming a fantastic manager.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.450
Now then, about this
mysterious white bat...

00:02:23.450 --> 00:02:27.250
Yay! My name is Babbit! I'm the
white bat who always butting in.

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.460
Don't make light of me! One, two...

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.790
He doesn't have anything to do with
the story, so we can leave him out.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:32.790
Ah, you're making light of me.

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:35.000
Hayama Akito.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:38.760
He started out as my natural enemy,
the boss monkey of 6th Grade 3rd Class.

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:42.430
Then Sana-chan fought him head-on,
and scored a great victory!

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:46.770
But then, whoops! Behind him was a
really boneheaded father-daughter team!

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:49.140
Geez, it's unforgivable
for people to be so dumb!

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.520
But Sana-chan's strategies
won out against them, too!

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.070
Now the Hayama household
enjoys a hospitable mood.

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:59.030
However...! You can't let your
guard down around Hayama Akito!

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.410
What are you doing!?

00:03:02.410 --> 00:03:04.620
Okay, okay, okay,
with all that being said,

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:08.080
before we get to today's story,
start the VTR from last time!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:11.750
Sana, how about we fulfill your promise?

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:16.750
I'd like to start writing
that essay about you and me.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.760
When will it be published?

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.090
Around the time summer vacation
is over, probably.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.100
♪ Thoroughly refreshing outdoor school! ♪

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.390
♪ Are you ready!? Are you ready!? ♪

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:33.100
You're worried about something, huh?

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.570
How come Hayama is the
only one who noticed?

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:40.650
Mama... Mama... might just hate me!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:47.450
"The Summer of My Promise - Part ll"

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.710
H- hey...

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:02.050
I'm not sure I understand it all,

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:05.890
but there aren't any mothers
who hate their own children, are there?

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:11.730
At least, that's what I think,
from the way you played my pretend mom.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.060
A-chan, about your Mama...

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:17.770
I love you, A-chan, and that's
why I tried so hard to have you.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:19.730
And so, for Mama's sake,

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.610
keep at it, and go on living,
okay, A-chan?

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:28.080
Don't you have any faith
in your own mom?

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.080
It's not that...

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:32.370
Then don't worry about it.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:37.040
Besides, there's no way
your mom could hate you.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:42.380
Could a child whose mother hates them
grow up to be as decent as you are?

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.380
You... think so...?

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:49.390
Yeah. And if your enjoyable life
together gets destroyed, then so what?

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.060
After it gets destroyed,
you can always patch it up again.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.730
Hayama...

00:04:58.730 --> 00:04:59.940
"Ice"

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:03.740
You know, nothing heats
shaved ice during the summer!

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:07.070
Onda-san, if you eat it too fast,
you'll upset your stomach.

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:10.200
This is nothing! I'm super-okay!

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.410
By the way, Onda-san,
about Sensei's current book...

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:17.080
Y-yes...?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.420
What is it about?

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:22.380
Oh, I don't have any idea--

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:28.760
All I know is that the title
will be "My Daughter and I."

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.100
--"My Daughter and I"?
--Oh dear, what's the matter, Onda-san?

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.680
--Which means that Sana-chan
--S- Shimura-san, do you have

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.020
--would have to be the main topic...
--any stomach medicine...?

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.020
Oh, good heavens!

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.850
The content of my essay?

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:43.690
Yes. As Sana-chan's manager,
I'd like to know.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.700
W- well it's...

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.700
I- it's...?

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.950
"Pbbbt!"

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:50.700
I'm not telling!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.990
Sensei...

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.040
However, there is one thing
I can tell you.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:55.710
What is that?

00:05:55.710 --> 00:06:00.710
Once this book goes on sale,
there is sure to be a terrible commotion.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.380
A terrible commotion..?

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:06.970
Sagami-kun, when that happens,
look after my girl for me.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.050
Look after Sana-chan?

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:13.010
Of course I will! Even now,
supposing there's an earthquake

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:14.390
while we're at work, I've got...

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:15.060
Hardtack!

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:15.730
"Fabian"
Pet bottle!

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:16.730
First aid set!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.730
Flashlight!

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:21.400
T- the batteries are dead!

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:25.070
I... I can't look after
Sana-chan like this!

00:06:25.070 --> 00:06:26.990
Sensei, if there's going
to be a terrible commotion

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.400
when this book comes out,
then what exactly--?

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:32.120
I'm working. Disturb me, and I'll
hop you on the forehead! I'm working.

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.700
--Disturb me, and I'll
bop you on the forehead!
--Sana-chan...

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.080
Snap to, would you?

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.040
Did I mention my dad got out of the
hospital the day before yesterday?

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:44.340
Uh, mm-hmm.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:48.380
So, our family is turning
into this happy circle...

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:51.050
Yeah, a happy circle? How so?

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.050
It started while we
were talking about you.

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.720
About me? What about? What about?

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:59.020
Well... I can't tell you.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.390
Why not?

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:02.690
I can't say... not to her...

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.270
The Hayama family's happy circle.

00:07:04.730 --> 00:07:06.730
My sweetheart has an ice cream heart!

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.400
If you love ice cream, I love you!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:11.410
Sana-chan is a good girl, huh?
A little strange, though.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:15.740
It would be fun if a girl like her became
Akito's wife, wouldn't it? Or not...

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:17.410
Won't ever happen.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.750
Why not?

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:20.410
Her husband will have
to marry into her family.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:21.710
Marry into her family...?

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:24.380
Well then, I guess you'd have
to become her husband, Akito.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.090
Why would you say that?

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.760
Natsumi, you'll go off and
marry somebody someday, right?

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.720
Sure, someday.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.840
What do you know? Dad is
going to be lonely, won't he?

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.010
What are you laughing at?

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:40.100
We can't have that! Maybe I
should take a husband in, too!

00:07:42.350 --> 00:07:46.020
You don't, by any chance,
want to laugh, too, do you?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.690
Ah, what are you remembering
that's making you laugh!?

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:49.360
It's nothing.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.820
Nothing? You said it was a
story about me, didn't you?

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.700
Tell me! Come on, come on, come on!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:58.160
Anyhow, everyone thinks that our home
has gotten a little bit more enjoyable,

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:01.040
thanks to you.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.370
All I did was give
everyone a little nudge.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:06.210
It's amazing that you
don't think to yourself,

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:09.050
"I've done this great thing"
the way you do.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:12.630
If it was me, and I had done something
even a little bit nice for someone,

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:16.390
I'd hold it over their head for the
rest of their life. You're incredible.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:21.390
I may not look it... but I
am awfully grateful to you.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.390
Hayama...

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:26.060
So, um, I'm just saying...

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:29.070
Hayama is putting everything
he has into telling me this...

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.650
I, uh...

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:34.660
I know this can't be easy for him...

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:43.000
I was thinking... if you get depressed
or anything... I'd like to help... so...

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:49.210
so... if you feel like crying,
come find me.

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:54.340
W- what a performance!
What a performance, Hayama!

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.010
"If you feel like crying, come find me."

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:58.890
Oh, I can't stand it!

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.020
Thanks.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.890
That makes me awfully happy, Hayama.

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.360
Kurata...

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.360
Ah! You smiled! You just smiled, Hayama!
You grinned!

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:16.700
I've only ever seen you snort,
or snicker,

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.700
but you just grinned!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:22.370
Hey, smile one more time!
It's so nice and cute!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:25.040
C- cute?

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.370
Oh! You're embarrassed!

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.710
Now you're embarrassed! This is
the first time I've ever seen that!

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:31.050
I saw it! I saw it! I saw it!
Hayama is embarrassed!

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.340
Embarrassed! Embarrassed!
Embarrassed! Hayama is embarrassed!

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:34.670
Embarrassed little boy!
Bashful little boy!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.340
Y- you're sure enjoying yourself.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:39.010
Hey, Hayama, smile one more time!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.010
How am I supposed to smile
when there's nothing funny?

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.680
But you just barely smiled, didn't you?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:46.020
Come on, make a happy face, A-chan!

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:49.020
W- what's the deal with you!?
You were crying just a moment ago!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.690
Oh, you got away!
You got away this time! Hold up!

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.030
Come on, smile one more time!

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.360
You're a pest!

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.360
All right, now I'm getting into this!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:00.370
♪ Hold it, hold it, Hayama!
Smile one more time! ♪

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:03.700
--♪ Break out your horns! ♪
--Break out your horns!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.700
♪ Break out a smiling face, Hayama-kun! ♪

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.710
♪ Hayama, smile! Let's see it! ♪

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:08.960
--♪ And while we're at it, let's dance! ♪
--Cut it out! Cut it out!

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.040
♪ One-two, one-two! ♪

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.040
♪ Won't you dance?
Won't you have some fun? ♪

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.050
♪ Won't you smile for me?
One more time, one more time! ♪

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:16.050
--♪ Whoa, don't run away, cute Hayama! ♪
--What a pest!

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:18.050
--♪ Come on! Come on! Dance! Step, step! ♪
--No! Cut it out!

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.050
♪ How rare, how rare,
seeing Hayama smile! ♪

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.050
♪ Don't be bashful, Hayama!
Look at me, Hayama! ♪

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.350
--♪ Come on! Come on! Dance! ♪
--Geez, what a pest!

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.060
--♪ One-two, one-two! ♪
--Cut it out!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.060
♪ Look over here for me! Smile for me! ♪

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.730
♪ Smile! Smile! Ha ha ha, ha! ♪

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:31.730
--♪ What fun! ♪
--I guess I was wrong after all
about her cheerfulness being an act.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.320
How do you like this!?

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:38.320
Smile, I say! Come on!
Come on! Laugh, I tell you!

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.990
What is the matter with you!?

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.330
--(I was so happy to see Hayama
smile for the first time,)
--Smile, Hayama! Come on! Come on!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.660
--(I didn't even notice
the swarm of fireflies)
--Shut up!

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.660
--(I didn't even notice
the swarm of fireflies)
--Ha ha ha! Wait up! Wait up!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:51.540
--(that I had wanted to see so badly,
and just ran around the whole time.)
--Smile, I say!

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:55.340
I caught you, Hayama!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.130
Look down.

00:10:59.340 --> 00:11:01.890
Wow! Looks like we managed
to climb up, huh?

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:04.680
We sure are amazing, aren't we?

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.890
Would you guys give it a rest, already?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:13.360
Uh-oh, it looks like the campfire
is over. When did that happen?

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:16.360
Well, let's go back to Firefly Inn.
Everyone is probably worried.

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:19.030
Yeah.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.240
W- what?

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:24.700
--Run-ta-ta, run-ta-ta!
--Cut it out.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.700
Come on, Hayama, sing along.
Run-ta-ta, run-ta-ta!

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:28.700
Run.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.040
All right, you!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.710
Geez, where did you two go off to!?

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.050
Uh-oh, looks like there was a big fuss.

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:38.050
Sana-chan, we were worried about you!

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.380
Akito-kun!

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:41.970
I thought you might
have been in an accident!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.720
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.140
And as a result, an essay on remorse.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:52.390
What are you laughing at,
in our situation?

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:55.400
My face is just laughing on its own.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.730
You're a weirdo.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:12:00.070
"If you feel like crying, come find me."

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:03.070
I was so happy for the wards
that Hayama offered me,

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:06.740
and felt that I really did have
a place to go when I felt like crying.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:08.910
I feel like the gloominess
in my heart has cleared up.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.750
Say, Sana-chan...

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.080
You've been getting on with
Hayama-kun pretty well lately, huh?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.420
Sound suspicious to me!

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:17.750
Mm-hmm! We are getting along.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.760
We were trying to tease you!

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:22.170
Right, Hayama!?
We're getting along, right!?

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:24.760
Oh, he's playing Tanuki!

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.760
That's called playing possum.

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:28.470
How cute! How cute! I know...!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.890
This week's Tanuki!

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:37.770
I'm all right. I can go home
to Mama with a smile on my face.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.740
I'm back!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:49.030
Welcome home! Did you have fun?

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.540
Mm-hmm! Maro-chan, I'm back!

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:55.750
Thanks!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:58.420
So, tell me all about it in your room.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.420
Okay!

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.090
Mama, is your manuscript done?

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.720
Yeah, right on time.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.380
Is that so? Nice work.

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:05.380
Welcome home.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:06.760
I'm back.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.050
Sana-chan, welcome home.

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:10.100
Rei-kun, long time no see!

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:15.770
Good. Sana-chan doesn't seem
any different than her usual self.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.310
The essay will be published
around the end of summer.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:19.440
I'm going to forget about it for a while.

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:21.320
I'm going to take it easy.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.780
And so, finally, it's summer vacation!!

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:26.410
Summer vacation!

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.780
But even so, I'm insanely busy!

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.370
I'm taking swimming lessons at school!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.080
--(Then there's rehearsals for the play
we're putting on at Komawari.)
--Tom!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.210
--(By the way, I'm playing
the heroine this year!)
--Ah, Tom is dead!

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:37.040
--(By the way, I'm playing
the heroine this year!)
--Tom! Tom! Tom! Tom!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:40.040
--(I'm all fired up about rehearsing.)
--Tom! Tom! Tom! Tom!

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.050
--Sana-chan! Let go!
--Tom! Tom! Tom! Tom!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.050
Don't die, Tom!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.050
--(I sing...)
--Be strong, Tom!

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.380
Get up, Tom! Tom! Tom Lincoln!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.050
I dance...

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:51.060
Gateball! Not this time, though.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:53.390
And then, in August...

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.430
The commercials I shot last month
all started appearing on TV,

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.390
bang-bang-bang-bang!

00:13:57.390 --> 00:14:00.060
--Bocari is a hit! Bocari Sweet!
--Huh? It's Sana-chan again.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.070
Wow, you sure are on a lot, huh?

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.070
Come on over again sometime, okay?

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.070
Don't talk to the TV.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:08.740
We'll be waiting here for you.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.410
Are you okay there, pops?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.740
Wash! Wash! One, two, four!
Ah! Too much came off!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:16.410
Just kidding! New Kid's Foam,
now on sale!

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.420
Accident insurance, just in case!

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:21.750
Wishing you a 1000-year-crane,
10,000-year-turtle life!

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:23.090
Sana-chan is so cute.

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.130
Mm-hmm, but you know what?

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:29.840
She's not just cute; being on TV
this much, Sana-chan is amazing.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:35.020
Sana-chan...

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.350
We saw them! We saw them!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.020
The commercials!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.440
It's incredible! We might not
see you at school every day,

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.020
but we can still see you on TV!

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.020
Ha ha!

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:44.690
Being on that much, you're going
to get tired of seeing me, huh?

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.360
What are you talking about?

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:50.280
Speaking of commercials,
Rei-kun booked another job,

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.370
and I'll be shooting it real soon.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.370
Oh? What is it this time?

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.700
"Heal-Band." It's a kind of bandage.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.370
--I'll be acting with a boy
who's the same age as us.
--Come on, come on, this way, this way...

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.710
--A boy?
--I can't see, I can't see.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.040
You're kidding! Who, who!? Tell us, who!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.040
Did you hear that, Akito-kun?
Did you hear?

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:05.420
Sana-chan says she is going
to shoot another commercial.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.710
This time, she's co-starring
with another boy.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.050
So what about it?

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:12.090
I wonder what kind of kid he is.
She said it was a boy,

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:14.050
so that definitely means
he's not a girl, huh?

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:17.390
And if he's not a girl,
that means he's a boy, right?

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:19.100
Of course it does.

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.900
Kamura Naozumi-kun!?

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.070
Awesome!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.400
What, is Kamura-kun that popular?

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:29.740
Good grief! Sana-chan,
you don't know him?

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:33.030
He's a gorgeous kid!
Almost like a girl!

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:35.030
Oh, my. Is he a nancy boy?

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:37.040
No, he's not. He's a bishonen.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.370
He does modeling and other stuff, too!

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.790
Right! And he has appeared
in dramas, as well.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.710
Like that one thing he was in...

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:46.040
--Say, could you get me his autograph?
--They say he's a bishonen.
I wonder what type.

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.840
I wonder if he's like
the ones in girls' manga,

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.380
where roses appear in the background,

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:53.050
and he's got eyes with pools
in them that sparkle...

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:54.600
Oh, Hayama, yoo-hoo!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.720
Disinfect yourself too long in there,
and your hiney will melt away!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.730
She said your hiney will melt away.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:03.400
It would be awful if your hiney melted
away, huh? You wouldn't be able to fart,

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:06.400
and when you sat down on a chair,
you wouldn't know how you should sit.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:07.070
Melt, would you?

00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:10.110
If that happened, I wonder if
your legs would come out abruptly,

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.740
right under your belly button...

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.410
Bishonen?

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.290
This week's Sana-chan!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.800
Ow...

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:33.220
What are you, stupid? I'll bet that hurt.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:36.010
Really, couldn't you think
a moment before you act?

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:40.140
You're always doing things you
don't think out, so you're always--

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:46.690
Listen, Akito-kun, nothing beats the
Bon odori dance during the summer, huh?

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:50.030
As a matter of fact, you know
the Bon odori dance next week?

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:53.030
Me and Aya-chan are
going to it together!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:57.700
Good grief, you're the first one
I've talked to about this, Akito-kun.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:01.120
A- Aya-chan will probably
wear a yukata, huh?

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:04.040
Whew, what am I going to do?
I wonder what I should wear.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.370
Aren't you happy-go-lucky?

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:10.380
Huh? That was kind of bitter.
Did something bad happen, Akito-kun?

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.050
Not really.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:17.340
Oh yeah! Akito-kun, did you know that
Sana-chan's Mama is publishing an essay?

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:20.720
H- how do you know about that!?

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:25.730
H- how? My mom saw an ad
in a magazine and told me.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:27.730
It's out in the magazines?

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:31.360
Mm-hmm, it said the title
would be "My Daughter and I."

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.650
It's going to be about Sana-chan, huh?

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:35.860
I can't wait.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:41.120
Mama is writing an essay on me.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.660
I promised her she could a long time ago,
so there's nothing I can do about it.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.370
The enjoyable life
that Mama and I share now...

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:48.750
...could all be completely destroyed!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:58.340
"The new novel by Kurata Misako
'My Daughter and I' Now taking preorders"

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:58.340
Hey, it says they're taking
preorders for Kurata Misako's essay.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.720
If it's "My Daughter and I," she must
be writing about Sana-chan, right?

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:05.480
Sounds interesting!
I think I'll reserve a copy!

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.350
Whatever!

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:12.690
It's all right. I've made up my mind
to take things easy, after all.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:17.070
Still, if I ever start
feeling like I want to cry...

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.950
I'll be relying on you, Hayama!

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:23.040
What's the matter, Akito?

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:25.080
N- nothing.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.750
W- what was that? I just felt
a twinge for a second there...

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:32.340
I haven't come down with
some nasty disease, right?

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:34.000
It's Sana-chan, I tell ya!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.340
The commercial shoot in question

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.760
"Kurata Sana-sama"

00:18:39.010 --> 00:18:40.680
Sana-chan! Are you ready?

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.350
Yes!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:45.350
Twirl! Twirl! Twirl!

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:48.350
Ta-da! Well? How do you
like my commercial costume?

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:50.350
Oho! Ballerina! Ballerina!

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:51.360
Does it look good on me?

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.360
Mm-hmm, it does, it does.

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.110
Lucky you, Sana-chan!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:59.030
Uchiyamada-kun and Zenjiro-san!
Are you shooting a commercial?

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.490
Yeah, that we are, but we...

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.040
...look like this.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:08.710
What's woise, we get clobb-uhed
by a shot of insecticide, and...

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:11.500
--"Waugh! We've had it!
--"Waugh! We've had it!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.250
--Roaches whimper, then pop off!"
--Roaches whimper, then pop off!"

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:19.050
That's how we hafta portray these
poor roaches that get extoiminated.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.720
Poor things...

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.510
We're both shooting commoicials,
but what a difference!

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.390
Well, what can you do?
Sana-chan, you're cute.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:28.390
So shua, you get to wear a cute outfit,
while we get to be roaches...

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:31.520
Mm-hmm! Zenjiro-san,
you tell it like it is!

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.730
Wait up!

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:40.990
If you think that all I am is cute,
you're going to get hurt.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:45.990
Behold! As learned in Gekidan Komawari,
the marvelous... un... deux... troi...!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.330
--They're pretty particular
about the way you twirl,
--Incredible, Sana-chan.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:54.330
as you'd expect of Komawari!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:57.000
By the way, is that boy
Kamura-kun here yet?

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.010
They said he'd be a little late.

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:01.010
--Sorry we're late.
--Oh, I'm starting to get dizzy.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.010
--Ah, you must be Kamura-kun's manager.
--I can't stop by myself

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:06.350
--The roads were all congested.
I'm really sorry about this.
--when I get like this!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.350
--Not at all, that's all right.
--Rei-kun, stop me!

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:11.810
--Sorry to keep you waiting.
I'm Kamura Naozumi.
--Stop me!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:22.700
Whoa! He really is an attractive boy!

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.360
Nice to meet you.

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:28.370
Nice to meet you. I'm Kurata.
It's a pleasure.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.700
The pleasure is mine.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:33.330
Wow! He's even prettier
than me when I'm in makeup!

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:37.090
Sana-chan, you've hurt her foot
at a ballet recital,

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:41.010
and couldn't dance all that well.
Then, as you're feeling down,

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:44.680
Naozumi-kun brings you a bouquet of
flowers and a box of Heal-Band. Got it?

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:45.340
Yes.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:47.010
Director, about this part...

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:48.010
You idiot! Not like that!

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:50.020
Wow! Very good! Naozumi-kun,
you look outstanding.

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:51.930
--I did a bang-up job on you!
--Come to think of it,
I have seen that kid.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:52.890
--I am a genius at this, after all!
--He's the boy who was
in that one recent drama,

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:55.020
--I am a genius at this, after all!
--and has appeared in several
other things, I'm sure of it.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.270
--Start!
--and has appeared in several
other things, I'm sure of it.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.840
Heal-Band...

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:23.380
Heal-Band...

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:25.090
Heal-Band.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.970
Heal-Band.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.270
Cut! Okay!

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:37.400
Oh, both of them are so adorable!

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:40.070
Boy, those two really are good at this.

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:42.070
Just one take, and we're okay?

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:43.400
Really?

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:44.740
Okay, job well done!

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.070
Nice work!

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:48.070
Thanks for working so hard, everyone.

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:53.080
I hope it's okay to be finishing
so soon. I kind of feel let down.

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.540
Ah, Sana-chan!

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:59.420
They said you can keep this. Here.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:02.090
Huh? You're giving these to me? Thanks!

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:04.760
Wow, how pretty!

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:12.100
Sana-chan...

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:14.600
I know your secret.

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:26.700
What!! What do you mean?

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:29.610
Who are you!?

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.470
In dire straits,

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.060
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.080
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.250
...for two.

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:09.880
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:12.880
Kamura Naozumi, who are you, really?

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:15.680
Oh, well, it's summer vacation,
it's summer vacation!

00:24:15.680 --> 00:24:18.520
But I can't be playing around!
I am a performer, after all!

00:24:18.520 --> 00:24:21.520
Gekidan Komawari is putting on a play,
and my heart is pounding!

00:24:21.520 --> 00:24:22.980
And after my heart stops
pounding over this,

00:24:22.980 --> 00:24:24.520
it will pound over something even bigger!

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:28.530
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 16; fate wraps itself around Sana.

00:24:28.530 --> 00:24:32.200
Heart-Pounding Twice Over

00:24:32.200 --> 00:24:34.450
Okay, break a leg!
